  <item>
    <title>Vol.19 世界这么大，还有我没吃过的美食？口水预警</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa1c53f9d3264778166bb77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa1c53f9d3264778166bb77</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 20:49:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期又集结了频道3位主播，一起聊聊美食这件事。三位主播来自三个各具特色的美食之乡，如果带朋友去自己家乡，会安排什么美食之旅？口味会随着长大，或者居住地变化而产生变化吗？吃过什么奇奇怪怪的东西，好吃吗？甚至吃饭遇到了很可怕的「玄学」事件！所以，食物的意义是什么？</span></p><p><span>这一期，让我们一起流口水吧🤣</span></p><p><span>🏷️Notes：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">00:02:55</a> 超级火爆的天津，究竟什么美食值得吃？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">00:11:47</a> “出了云南，其他地方都是美食荒漠🌵”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">00:21:05</a> 让本美食荒漠本人来说说浙江金华的好吃的😋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">00:39:11</a> 天津人出国后，越发想念家乡这一口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3026">00:50:26</a> 云南人不仅吃辣，还能尝鲜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">01:00:02</a> 豆浆到底应该是甜的还是咸的？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4386">01:13:06</a> 吹过最猎奇的东西是“狗肉”？？？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5146">01:25:46</a> 再也不吃现杀的一场「玄学噩梦」⚠️</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5440">01:30:40</a> 美食的意义？</span></p><p></p><p><span>🍚提及美食：</span></p><p><span>⬇️天津大饼夹一切</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNN0bcOXGRTTc1fZqKQFZfZzVo3.jpg"></figure><p><span>⬇️天津馄炖</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmOvelD5Xt3fOiTgHA6EQ0Tj_PQh.jpg"></figure><p><span>臭豆腐配炸馒头⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh9vsH5NGEywjx9k8xSTQFinUsb2.jpg"></figure><p><span>臭豆腐配窝头⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2wJDuoKLsNe2_prBktQKP4BiD8.jpg"></figure><p><span>铜锅涮肉⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJNfHhN3dkFgvSagCyQ_KkOp49u.jpg"></figure><p><span>洋芋粑粑⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDiq576ThdPpNGrvzYHLgQIgrmr.jpg"></figure><p><span>烧饵块⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQ_bCa_vhMWfxpRXxaHC6j38EYn.jpg"></figure><p><span>玉溪小吃⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luTjpKKgiOQmu65-MqIHN_VqkuFx.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv9pqEP1uBirh8mvLyHcxzFsR3_9.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnx20mUi5p8-48jHCs_Sc_UVYdCw.jpg"></figure><p><span>酱油鸡⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lirADW5yhEmyJVY6twBD1AViZjqx.jpg"></figure><p><span>臭豆腐小锅米线⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9Eeem-ha2hMbk3dPVt3w-lilZK.jpg"></figure><p><span>稀豆粉米线⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneeXatkwvP--3e4iw1zu-KMQ3ht.jpg"></figure><p><span>干巴菌⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqD7uvQRdc7qarIceQoeuYa4UV9U.jpg"></figure><p><span>火腿洋芋焖饭⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3Ipuil-Fa0MXok_PDlbdr0XR4H.jpg"></figure><p><span>金华小笼包⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUGHiGej7pwMh1uW382UW6gaTvs.png"></figure><p><span>金华大饼油条⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEXGxTE6HuVoKdbNJ3VLxdzdg01.png"></figure><p><span>金华肉汤圆⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiefPdFxbYuo6byzmFJbpVE5Pi5i.png"></figure><p><span>金华馒头⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtAl6wUGeK2T6SSgExgoF3rSN7Zn.png"></figure><p><span>金华笋汤⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlflBcRY8M1Yjigip3DEwsyTCw1q.jpg"></figure><p><span>金华两头乌⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-ePYLnXupQGIVJSKpS0Ms1Otrs.png"></figure><p><span>金华火腿⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8xb6VYOC6q3ik7VAkyjmm-nUpf.png"></figure><p><span>金华香肠⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoBN_r2rZXEM5mqJpr31a_WuCj3K.png"></figure><p><span>金华清凉膏⬇️</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuK05CXl-KhX6acFf2r51FFXC8Q0.png"></figure><p><span>🎵BGM: In my imagination - Devin Kennedy</span></p><p><span>🍓小红书：</span></p><p><span>Vanessa波波然</span></p><p><span>木木生活本</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>哈哈哈哈最后祝大家都能享受美食！</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
