  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 海外中女的邪修之道：玄学，独居，稀烂的开始</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69572b2d2db086f897401276</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69572b2d2db086f897401276</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 02:27:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我和木木，两位现居加拿大的中年少女的2025年总结。远赴重洋来到海外重启人生，工作，爱好，友谊，玄学，当我们开始全方位感受自己，我们感受到了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望听到这期的你，精神力满满，百邪不侵！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「工作」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> &nbsp;完成比完美更重要，请稀烂的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 邪修之重启人生：做号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 珍惜自己的三分钟热度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 白领工作才是工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 加拿大职场，从松绑开始</span></p><span></span><p><span>「友谊」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 2025年，友情滑铁卢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 真诚是永远的必杀技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 没有消息，就是最好的消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a> Double Date教老公做人‼️</span></p><span></span><p><span>「玄学」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3232">53:52</a> 行善与命定论究竟是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3761">1:02:41</a> 今年玄学真的给了我实际指引</span></p><span></span><p><span>「个人修炼终极法门」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4125">1:08:45</a> 修炼孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4341">1:12:21</a> 学会开始与等待⌛️</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Flower （Piano Version） - Johnny Stimson</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍓小红书：</span></p><span></span><p><span>波波然Vanessa</span></p><span></span><p><span>波波然助眠</span></p><span></span><p><span>木木生活本</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家新年快乐！平安喜乐，顺顺利利，发大财！💰&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
