  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 从「玄学」浅聊如何建立稳定内核</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6902d34dabb5e1cf58155bcc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6902d34dabb5e1cf58155bcc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 02:59:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期关于「内核」, 聊着聊着, 忽然发现很多问题从「玄学」角度一看, 哎呀妈呀, 都通了!</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以, 就干脆结合我和大米的自身经历, 结合大米的特殊(小众)爱好「玄学」, 浅浅分享一下我们自己对于建立稳定内核的感受和看法.&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝福听到这期的你, 精神力满满, 百邪不侵!</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span>「什么是内核?」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 内核是界定边界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 内核这件事, 就是修仙</span></p><span></span><p><span>「何时觉察到内核的存在?」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 内核的根源, 来自于「爱❤️」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a> 从困境中长出了内核</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 如何建立自信?</span></p><span></span><p><span>「如何修炼内核?」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 超简单: 请不要熬夜了宝宝老师们😊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 能量使用法则: 专注力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 从八字角度如何修炼内核?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 修行人的自我修炼方法: 觉察(干货预警⚠️)</span></p><span></span><p><span>「我们的人生到底在修炼什么?」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a> 见自己, 见天地, 见众生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3306">55:06</a> 平衡的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Asphyxia - CIKI</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍓Vanessa恬然</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书: 波波然Vanessa&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
