  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 35岁女人, 仅一条人生建议</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e1dc208e321a0d6ff3665b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e1dc208e321a0d6ff3665b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Oct 2025 02:52:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>三个女人一台戏🤣 这次集齐了「恬不知痴」3位女主播, 一起讨论“兴趣爱好”这个话题. 如果说要让35岁女人给出一条人生建议, 那就是请让爱好搞得更猛烈些吧!!</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 当我们在谈论“爱好”时,我们在谈论什么?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">02:31</a> 小时候那些滋养你的爱好</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 大米: 画画🧑‍🎨是我的生命之光</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 恬然: 小学五年级毕业, 我画🧑‍🎨了一本漫画</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> 木木: &nbsp;3岁学画🧑‍🎨, 被石膏像吓哭🤣</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 长大后, 爱好如何流动?</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1851">30:51</a> 大米: 画画➡️设计, 兴趣终于作为工作, 我快乐吗?</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 木木: 画画➡️手工➡️烘焙, 兴趣真的无法用来赚钱</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 恬然: 画画➡️配音➡️摄影➡️写同人小说➡️做短视频账号➡️做播客: 《论爱好的流动性》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3778">01:02:58</a> 中年少女的爱好?</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3824">01:03:44</a> 木木: 一个很爽的中年爱好</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">01:09:47</a> 恬然: 女人必须独处</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4379">01:12:59</a> 大米: 种花种草DNA觉醒🌿以及, 有钱有闲打游戏🎮</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5225">01:27:05</a> 终极问题: 如何获得幸福的人生? 平静而猛烈得搞爱好吧!!</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM: May I Ask (feat. Alexis Kim) - AK/Mapps</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍓小红书:</span></p><span></span><p><span>恬然Vanessa:</span></p><span></span><p><span>波波然Vanessa</span></p><span></span><p><span>木木:</span></p><span></span><p><span>木木生活本</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝大家活得平静而热烈!!💗</span></p>]]></description>
