  <item>
    <title>Vol. 08 结婚后才悟出:选伴侣重要的点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6814d4846970cc7b4d64d455</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6814d4846970cc7b4d64d455</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 14:38:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期想聊聊老生常谈的爱情观💓当今社会还存在真爱吗?如何筛选对的人?婚姻经营的尽头是“爱自己”?</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为已婚妇女的我和木木,其实也并没有正确答案.就像一个白卷,也许我们侥幸先交了卷,但是却等不来分数公布的那一天.</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论单身,结婚,生子,或是离婚,继续单身,继续恋爱,世界上没有规定好的范式,你觉得好的就是最好的生活.</span></p><span></span><p><span>[因为前半段我们麦出现了点问题,所以木木的声音🔊很轻🧎希望大家不要介意嘿嘿]</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 小时侯的爱情观被道明寺荼毒?🤣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 挑选对象,最基础的点是?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 女生不可以“作”?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 善良?好土好肤浅的特质?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 如何判断对方是否善良?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> 一次反面教材之相亲到一个“耿直男”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 比承诺更重要的是?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 挑选对象,最重要的点是?三观不合?门当户对?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3352">55:52</a> 婚姻如何经营? 婚姻的尽头是?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3565">59:25</a> 究竟什么是“爱自己”?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3842">01:04:02</a> 爱情里,互补or相似,怎样更好?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4772">01:19:32</a> 吵架里的有效沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Asphyxia - CIKI</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍓Vanessa恬然</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书:Vanessa波波然</span></p><span></span><p><span>木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书:木木生活本</span></p><span></span><p><span>MooMoo烘焙</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后祝大家无论如何,都开心!</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67757c0a9b73df5c10f105ba/lgcrFISBSQNFUqO45TUqpt2fcKlR.m4a" length="81935301" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2Wn0nBY3JTnMsWCJWXjJeFmw04.png"/>
