  <item>
    <title>Vol.07 985毕业端盘子，辞职创业才是当代年轻人的出路？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67df7afadd11f9c8c174e916</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67df7afadd11f9c8c174e916</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Mar 2025 03:22:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“不上班，开一家店，咖啡馆☕️or花店🌺，守着自己的一亩三分地，悠闲度过余生”的梦想我也做过。北大毕业卖煎饼果子，985毕业端盘子，辞职创业才是当代年轻人的出路吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，就来聊聊大米在餐饮服务业摸爬滚打的7年。餐饮服务业创业？想好这些再行动吧🤣</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏷️Notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 魔都白领辞职回小镇做餐饮，究竟为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 餐饮服务业的7年，赚了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 辞职创业，先想好这几个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 25岁当领导，如何服众？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3905">01:05:05</a> 最崩溃的瞬间之看到满地的泔水，我崩溃了 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4692">01:18:12</a> 失败经验之我以为大赚结果亏损的店，究竟怎么回事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4960">01:22:40</a> 那些年离谱的鸡零狗碎之招到了一个偷拍狂员工，和👮演戏追回欠款，被人威胁让你见不到明天的太阳&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5710">01:35:10</a> 是什么支撑了这7年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5923">01:38:43</a> 为什么最后我还是离开了餐饮服务业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6123">01:42:03</a> 究竟什么人适合创业？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Asphyxia - CIKI</span></p><span></span><p><span>acro - yutaka hirasaka</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍓Vanessa恬然</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Vanessa波波然</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67757c0a9b73df5c10f105ba/lpQwQQUQVGZ1qsSCmKH1uffbNBiB.m4a" length="105221773" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:45:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2Wn0nBY3JTnMsWCJWXjJeFmw04.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 北美职场，如何在白人外企打怪升级</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bbf82c05a90dfd0d71accc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bbf82c05a90dfd0d71accc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Feb 2025 05:01:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：Emma</span></p><p><span>高中以后来到加拿大，放弃表演，学习热门会计专业，从上课完全听不懂，到成为北美打工人，如何在人生这场游戏里打怪升级🎮。</span></p><p><span>🏷️Notes:</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 选择会计专业，因为一场赌气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 如何找到第一份工作？感谢那些年拉过的赞助</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 什么节点觉得应该跳槽了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 一个会计转行成了合规师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 究竟怎样学好英语？！学语言真的要过脑子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> 外国同寝室同学，带我大开眼界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2631">43:51</a> 亚裔乖乖女如何避免成为出气筒【熟读背诵！】</span></p><p><span>“I think the conversation is not productive anymore, let's take it offline and regroup it another day."</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">53:53</a> 如何有效实现跨部门项目管理？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3743">01:02:23</a> 国内🆚国外职场，究竟哪边才是人情社会？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4218">01:10:18</a> 如何和老板的老板建立良好的关系？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4489">01:14:49</a> 喜剧的妙用：给自己立一个有趣人设</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4958">01:22:38</a> 没有规划，看未来将我带到哪里</span></p><p><span>🎵BMG：</span></p><p><span>Asphyxia - CIKI</span></p><p><span>🍓Vanessa恬然：</span></p><p><span>小红书：波波然Vanessa</span></p>]]></description>
